EastSun 20260929: "請繼續你沒做完的工作" + "套到最新第 76 包". Cumulative over the nine packages (the laptop file = the last
package carrying it; base = the first package's base_<prev>): 357 files, NEW 126 / OLD 218 / LOCAL 12 / SAME 1 / GONE 0.
OLD files carrying machine tags: 11, none with a machine line missing in the laptop final.

LOCAL (three-way, machine changes kept):
- clean: cinitial.cpp (TEMP-DOORS), database.cpp (BOOTSPEED-1 sampler), JsonBridge/ChanMotorPoints.cpp (AXISLOCK lock.motors),
  tests/test_web_motor_access.cpp, WebMotorAccess.cpp/.h, WebMotorAccessLive.cpp (AXISLOCK, ALMRST, BRAKE-AXIS with pkg 71
  WSLINK-B page-close protection), web Main.gbControlBtn.html.
- WebBridge/WebBridgeServer.cpp (1): machine side -- TOKEN-OFF (`|| !cfg.enforceControlToken`), which main did not take (0018).
- cStateRecord.cpp (2): SR-HANG kept (job + timeout, op-log notes) with the laptop's thread-safe W906_StateRecordLogLater
  instead of RecordProcess on the worker; no CloseHandle of FProcessInformation (W906_SrRunAndWait owns the handles).
- tools/wb_serve.cpp (10): machine side for TOKEN-OFF (cfg.enforceControlToken, START line), the op-log SREC/BRAKE notes and
  their registration, the MOT cardErr/drvAlm/drvHome/gear fields, HMI-KEEP + STOPBTN at EOF; laptop side for FLOW-5
  W906_MbServoOffInArmLikeGolden, TK-1 W906_OwnerHeldSince and the native-forms block; two same-line merges: the pump line
  = HMI keeper + the laptop's W906_OwnerHeldSince MotorAccessTick, the loop-end line = the laptop's PAGETAB-Q51 +
  FRW-S167 + W906_ExternalQuitDue after W906_ServeQuitDue.
- web/page/ht9045_recipe_client.js (5): laptop side (it merged machine 0016 TAKEOVER and refined it: TK-2 query, dryRun ->
  acquire).
All applied files' LastWriteTime set to now (Copy-Item had kept the clone's times: 243 of 356 were older than the
existing objects, and the first -O2 link picked stale objects).

Verified: syntax check of the 8 LOCAL C++ files rc=0; test_web_motor_access 568 passed / 0 failed (scratch build);
full wb_serve build in build_integ_ship_x86_o2 EXIT 0, MZ/PE ok. Not yet run on the machine.
Not in this commit: MachineType.h (EastSun's own SOFT_SIMULTE edit), tools/vscode-htdesigner (another session).
Notice from package 72: the engine -> 1203 motor route is the laptop's (RULINGS_20260929 #11) -- the machine side does not
change Motor/myEthercatmotor.cpp.

